<title>USA: US to sell $30 bln of 2-, 5-yr notes Feb 25, 26.</title>
<headline>US to sell $30 bln of 2-, 5-yr notes Feb 25, 26.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-02-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Treasury Department said on Wednesday that it will sell $17.5 billion of two-year notes on Feb 25 and $12.5 bln of five-yr notes on Feb 26 to refund $27.695 billion of securities maturing Feb 28 and to raise $2.3 billion of new cash.</p>
<p>The notes will be issued on Feb 28. The two-year notes mature on Feb 28, 1999, and the five-year notes mature on Feb 28, 2002.</p>
<p>The CUSIP number for the 2-year notes will be 9128272K7 and for the five-year notes will be 9128272L5.</p>
